  <ym-title|Actual local reset reorganization \V
  draft><label|actual-local-reset-reorganization--draft>

  Pinned source revision: 3456e5e75cf8d4cd558955a5c7638fba2d68f464. No source
  edits, fresh Lean build or axiom replay.

  Inspected declarations, all below Lean/YM/AnalyticBridge/VERIFIED_RESET_STEP
  unless otherwise indicated:

  <\itemize-minus>
    <item>Projection.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.coeff_diagonal>,
    <verbatim|coeff_bound>, <verbatim|projection_diag>,
    <verbatim|projection_bound>, <verbatim|projection_eq>,
    <verbatim|quad_moves>.

    <item>Isotropy.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Averaging.Projects.series>,
    <verbatim|total_turn>, <verbatim|isotropic>, <verbatim|identity>,
    <verbatim|delta_bound>.

    <item>Residual.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Residual.payout>,
    <verbatim|rebate>, <verbatim|fault>, <verbatim|rebate_vanish>,
    <verbatim|rebate_sup>, <verbatim|fault_sup>; actual mask sign retained.

    <item>Rows.lean, Quadratic.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Low.live>,
    <verbatim|home>, <verbatim|plain>, <verbatim|proxy>, <verbatim|fresh>,
    <verbatim|loan>, <verbatim|fresh_bill>, <verbatim|fresh_vanish>,
    <verbatim|loan_bound>, <verbatim|loans_identity>. Halo includes kept-row
    predicate.

    <item>Geometry.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Geo.enlarge>,
    <verbatim|low_geometry>, <verbatim|high_geometry>,
    <verbatim|lower_budget>, <verbatim|high_budget>,
    <verbatim|rowCost_shape>, <verbatim|low_vs>; low/high cover constants
    85/9; enlarged support increment 81.

    <item>Quotes.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Quotes.enlarging>,
    <verbatim|channel_mass>, <verbatim|rows>; exponent +3 early, +1 hit;
    exact width conditions.

    <item>Investor.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Collection.regularNeed>,
    <verbatim|hitNeed>, <verbatim|softNeed>, <verbatim|Local.quote_family>,
    <verbatim|Local.renew>.

    <item>Channels.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.true_base>,
    <verbatim|allGoodPrice>, <verbatim|sketch_sum>; signed average retained.

    <item>Rewrites.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Collection.Local.first_split>,
    <verbatim|path_split>.

    <item>Evaluation.lean: <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Collection.Local.exponent>,
    <verbatim|raw_evaluator>, <verbatim|actual>.

    <item>Inputs.lean, Payment.lean, Advance.lean:
    <verbatim|YM.AnalyticBridge.VerifiedReset.Return.grants>,
    <verbatim|records>, <verbatim|catalog>, <verbatim|settled>,
    <verbatim|remainders>, <verbatim|reset>. Recipe permission not inferred
    from equality.

    <item>Lean/YM/UVNext/COUPLING_RESET/Regular.lean:
    <verbatim|YM.UVNext.CouplingReset.preBound>, <verbatim|Prereset.flat>,
    <verbatim|Prereset.value_income>, <verbatim|Prereset.income>.

    <item>Precision.lean in the same directory:
    <verbatim|YM.UVNext.CouplingReset.unmasked_precision>,
    <verbatim|higher_estimate>, <verbatim|late_cubic>, <verbatim|pays_cubic>,
    <verbatim|pays_surplus>.
  </itemize-minus>

  Canonical reuse: local-splitting, soft-log-fusion,
  nonlinear-payment-selection, rg-multisource, selected-nonlinear-offering,
  coupling-reset-selection. Elementary finite-dimensional Hessian
  polarization, absolute sum rearrangement and masked algebra developed in
  the text; no external literature replacement invoked.

  Retained frontier: common scale purchases, actual recipe permissions,
  upstream local channel derivative bounds and simple Lie algebra invariant
  bilinear form fact are used in their stated places. This is an actual
  reorganization/Prereset proof for that local return, not an independent
  Gaussian return supplier. Independent review pending. This file is not yet
  imported into the main manuscript.

  Review repair: explicit natural order/power with p\<gtr\>=1, actual signed
  clover (StressFlux/Clover stencil and VERIFIED_RESET_STEP/Lines
  petals_deriv), Squares.analogue_pair/metric_test normalization c_direct
  I+S(0)^T S(0)=I, and uniform stage alphaBound from UVNext/Precision. Fixed
  missing TeX backslash.

